            "review_title": "Review at Sadhu - Hoang Dao Thuy",
            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nInteresting food, nice venue but chilly near the door/window\nNov 2025 • Friends\nI came here mid week with a friend for the first time. Even though it was empty when we arrived, we were sat the nearest to the door and windows, which was chilly.\nThe menu is a little overwhelming if im honest. But the portion sizes allow you to sample a good selection. Everything was very well presented and some dishes were amazing (green rice soup, mushroom rice tacos etc.) some were less so. Staff were happy to recommend dishes to us, including that we should have a salad to balance out the greasy food which made us laugh!\nRead more\nWritten November 22, 2025",
